# Is the hallway dance a delay instability?

Steady-state resizing (arc changes per tick, last 2000 of 5000 ticks, activation scenario, N=200, R=5) as the shrink persistence constant `shrink_k` varies. Persistence = shrink_k x lag, so reaction gain ~ 1/shrink_k. `own` = persistence scaled to each agent's own lag (the repo's rule); `global` = one network-wide constant at the same mean lag. Mixed lags span 4..28; equal lags are all 16 (same mean).

12 seeds/cell. Environment: Python 3.14.8, numpy 2.5.1.

